-- ============================================================================
-- v1369: Seed / sample data — SIT (v1368) for the demo project
-- ============================================================================
-- Owner request 2026-11-09: sample SIT cycles for project SEED334-PRJ-08 (fictional "Northbridge Bank"
-- core banking replacement), consistent with the sample Testing Strategy (SIT 30 Nov 2026 – 29 Jan 2027):
--   * Cycle 1 – interface connectivity dry run (complete: execution, defects, sign-off)
--   * Cycle 1 – digital channels early start (in execution: partial results, open defects)
--   * Cycle 1 – customer and accounts, payments, lending, general ledger (preparing cases) and
--     trade finance and treasury (planning)
--   * Cycle 2, Cycle 3 and regression before UAT (planned)
-- Every record has scope, integration flows, readiness checks, test sets and risks; execution, defect
-- and sign-off figures only where the cycle has run. Vendor-neutral (rule 26); person fields are plain
-- text (fictional names). display_id = '' so Admin ID Generation assigns it (rule 16.2); fixed hex-only
-- ids …-4000-b017-… (the a017 range is used by the ICT Delivery Overview seed, v1355);
-- ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING; nothing inserted if the project is missing.
-- Prerequisites: v1368. Idempotent.
-- ============================================================================

